 changes status after creation.\",\n   \"Request deletion capability; no deletion API operation is exposed.\",\n   \"Search, alternative sorting, or paging.\",\n   \"Comments, attachments, assignees, or due dates.\",\n   \"Notifications, email, or live updates.\",\n   \"Dark mode, animation, or non-English localization.\",\n   \"Additional record types or additional API operations.\"\n  ],\n  \"requirements\": [\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The app is open at its home address.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-1.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the Hive Works wordmark and SC, and the selected request's detail screen; the app exposes only the Requests and request detail screens.\",\n      \"when\": \"The Requests screen is rendered and a request row is opened.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works app shall provide exactly two screens, a Requests list screen and a request detail screen, for the demo user Sam Carter with initials SC.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-1\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request is created through the API.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-2.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response and persisted row contain a system-generated ID and creation timestamp, title, area, priority, and status, and contain a description only if one was supplied.\",\n      \"when\": \"The created request is retrieved by ID.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works data model shall define only maintenance request records with a system-generated ID and creation timestamp, a required title, area, priority, and status, and an optional description.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-2\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.94\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A create request contains a missing or invalid title, area, or priority, or a description longer than 500 characters.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-3.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response identifies each invalid field in an error message and no request row is created.\",\n      \"when\": \"The request is submitted to the API.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A create request contains valid field values at the stated length limits.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-3.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response contains a created request row with those field values.\",\n      \"when\": \"The request is submitted to the API.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall accept only titles of 3 to 80 characters, areas from Kitchen, Meeting room, Open desk, Washroom, and Reception, priorities from Low, Normal, and Urgent, and descriptions of at most 500 characters when supplied.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-3\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"I-4\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.97\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A create request contains a title and description with leading or trailing whitespace.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-4.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response and persisted row contain the trimmed values.\",\n      \"when\": \"The request is submitted to the API.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A create request contains a title that is blank after trimming.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-4.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response contains a Title error and no request row is created.\",\n      \"when\": \"The request is submitted to the API.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall trim leading and trailing whitespace from title and description values before validation and storage, and treat a title that is blank after trimming as missing.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-4\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.98\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The database is empty.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-5.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The database contains exactly 8 seed request rows: 4 Open, 2 In progress, and 2 Done, including an Urgent Open row and at least one row for each supported area.\",\n      \"when\": \"The app initializes.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The database already contains request rows.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-5.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The database row count and all pre-existing request values are preserved, with no seed rows added.\",\n      \"when\": \"The app initializes or restarts.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When an empty database is initialized, the Hive Works app shall insert exactly eight seed requests with four Open requests including one Urgent request, two In progress requests, two Done requests, and every supported area represented, and shall preserve existing requests without inserting seeds when the database is nonempty.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-5\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"Q-6\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request has been created and persisted.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-6.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The API response and database row still contain the request and its stored values.\",\n      \"when\": \"The page is reloaded and the application is restarted before retrieving that request by ID.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works app shall persist requests in the database across page reloads and application restarts.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-6\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.95\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The API contract is available.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-7.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The API operation list contains only list, create, get-by-ID, and change-status operations.\",\n      \"when\": \"Its operations are inspected.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall expose exactly four operations: list requests with an optional status filter, create a request, get a request by ID, and change a request's status.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-7\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-4\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.94\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"Requests exist with different statuses and creation timestamps.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-8.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response list contains all requests for no filter or only matching-status requests for a filter, ordered by descending creation timestamp; the relative order of equal timestamps is not asserted.\",\n      \"when\": \"The list operation is called without a filter and then with each supported status filter.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall return all requests or only requests matching an optional single status, ordered newest first by creation timestamp.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-8\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-5\",\n     \"Q-3\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.98\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A valid create request is submitted, including any caller-supplied values for system-controlled fields.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-9.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response and database row contain status Open and system-generated ID and creation timestamp values.\",\n      \"when\": \"The API completes creation.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When the Hive Works API creates a request, it shall set the status to Open and set the ID and creation timestamp itself.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-9\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-2\",\n     \"I-4\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request has status Open, In progress, or Done.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response and database row show the requested new status for each transition.\",\n      \"when\": \"The API receives its respective allowed transition Open to In progress, In progress to Done, or Done to Open.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request has status Open and a status change to Done is submitted.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-10.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response contains an error and the database row status remains Open.\",\n      \"when\": \"The API processes the disallowed transition.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall allow only the status transitions Open to In progress, In progress to Done, and Done to Open, and shall reject every other status transition without changing the stored status.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-10\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"I-8\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.98\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request has stored title, area, priority, and description values.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-11.1\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The response and database row retain the original values.\",\n      \"when\": \"An API request attempts to change those values after creation.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The API contract is available.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-11.2\",\n      \"level\": \"api\",\n      \"then\": \"The API operation list contains no request deletion operation.\",\n      \"when\": \"Its operations are inspected.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works API shall prevent changes to a request's title, area, priority, and description after creation and shall expose no request deletion operation.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-11\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-3\",\n     \"I-4\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.94\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The Requests screen is opened without a previously selected filter.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-12.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the Hive Works wordmark, SC, all four filter choices with All selected, and the New request button.\",\n      \"when\": \"The screen finishes rendering.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works Requests screen shall show the Hive Works wordmark, the initials SC, an All filter selected by default, the Open, In progress, and Done filters, and a New request button.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-12\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-1\",\n     \"I-5\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.95\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The list contains requests with different creation timestamps.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-13.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The list shows each row's title, area, priority badge, status badge, and UTC creation date in date-only form, ordered newest first, and the screen shows the selected request's details.\",\n      \"when\": \"The Requests screen is rendered and a row is selected.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works Requests screen shall show each request's title, area, priority badge, status badge, and creation date in newest-first order, and shall open the detail screen when a request row is selected.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-13\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.95\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The seeded requests are available on the Requests screen.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-14.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows exactly 2 matching request rows and the In progress filter is the only selected filter.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user selects In progress.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A status filter other than All is selected.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-14.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows requests of every status and the All filter is the only selected filter.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user selects All.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When a user selects a status filter on the Hive Works Requests screen, the app shall select only that filter and show requests matching it, while All shows requests of every status.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-14\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\",\n     \"I-8\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The Requests screen is displayed.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the creation dialog with labeled Title, Area, Priority, and Description fields, the supported select values, Normal selected by default, and Create and Cancel buttons.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user selects New request.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When the user selects New request, the Hive Works app shall open a dialog with Title, Area, Priority, and Description fields, Area and Priority selects containing the supported values, Priority defaulted to Normal, and Create and Cancel buttons.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-15\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.95\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The creation dialog is open.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the dialog still open and the Title field message “Title must be 3 to 80 characters.” beneath the field.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user submits a title of 2 characters.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The creation dialog is open with a missing area or a description longer than 500 characters.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-16.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows a validation message naming the invalid field beneath that field and keeps the dialog open.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user selects Create.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When creation field validation fails, the Hive Works app shall keep the creation dialog open and show the field's validation message beneath that field.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-16\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-4\",\n     \"I-5\",\n     \"Q-1\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.97\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The creation dialog is open while a filter other than All is selected.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-17.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the dialog closed, All selected, and the new Open request at the top of the list.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user submits valid values and the API creates the request.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"When request creation succeeds, the Hive Works app shall close the dialog and show the new Open request at the top of the list, switching the selected filter to All if another filter was selected.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-17\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\",\n     \"Q-7\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.98\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The creation dialog contains valid values and the create request is pending.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-18.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the Create button disabled and the API receives only 1 create call.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user attempts to submit again before the request completes.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The API returns a non-validation creation failure.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-18.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows a generic creation error, retains the dialog and entered field values, and allows another submission.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user submits the creation dialog.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"While a create request is being sent, the Hive Works app shall disable the Create button and shall show a generic creation error while keeping the dialog values open and allowing another submission if creation fails for a non-validation reason.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-18\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\",\n     \"Q-4\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.98\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The list request is pending, returns no matching requests, or fails to load.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-19.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows “Loading requests…” while pending, “No requests here.” when empty, or “Could not load requests.” with a Retry button on failure.\",\n      \"when\": \"The Requests screen renders each respective state.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The Requests screen shows the load error and Retry button.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-19.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the returned request list.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user selects Retry and loading succeeds.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"While the request list is loading, empty for the selected filter, or unavailable, the Hive Works app shall show the corresponding loading, empty, or error state and provide Retry for the error state.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-19\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-5\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request with a description is opened from the list.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the request fields, badges, date-only creation date, description, and Back link.\",\n      \"when\": \"The detail screen renders.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request without a description is opened from the list.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows “No description.” and a Back link.\",\n      \"when\": \"The detail screen renders.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A status filter was selected before a request was opened.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-20.3\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows the Requests list with the previously selected filter still selected.\",\n      \"when\": \"The user follows the detail screen's Back link.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works request detail screen shall show a Back link, the request title, area, priority badge, status badge, UTC creation date in date-only form, and the description or “No description.” when the description is absent.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-20\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\",\n     \"Q-8\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.97\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"A request is displayed with each of the statuses Open, In progress, or Done.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-21.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows Start work, Mark done, or Reopen respectively, and after a successful response the status badge and action button show the new status and next action.\",\n      \"when\": \"The detail screen renders and the user selects its status action.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"The Hive Works request detail screen shall show Start work for Open requests, Mark done for In progress requests, and Reopen for Done requests, and shall update the status badge and action button after a successful status change.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-21\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.97\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The detail screen shows a request with a known status.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-22.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows “Could not update the request.” and the status badge retains its previous value.\",\n      \"when\": \"The API returns a failure for the status update.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"If a status update fails, then the Hive Works app shall show “Could not update the request.” and keep the previously displayed status.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-22\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.96\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The detail screen is opened with an unknown ID.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-23.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows “Request not found.” and a link back to the Requests screen.\",\n      \"when\": \"The ID lookup completes.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The detail screen is opened with a known ID and loading fails for a non-not-found reason.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-23.2\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen shows a generic loading error and a Retry action, not “Request not found.”\",\n      \"when\": \"The load failure is returned.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"If a request ID is unknown, then the Hive Works app shall show “Request not found.” with a link back to the Requests screen, and if loading a known ID fails for another reason, the app shall show a generic loading error with Retry.\",\n    \"id\": \"REQ-23\",\n    \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n    \"sources\": [\n     \"I-6\",\n     \"Q-5\"\n    ],\n    \"stability\": 0.97\n   },\n   {\n    \"acceptance\": [\n     {\n      \"given\": \"The Requests and request detail screens are rendered.\",\n      \"id\": \"AC-REQ-24.1\",\n      \"level\": \"ui\",\n      \"then\": \"The screen uses the specified light-theme text, background, font, and badge colour categories, and each badge shows its status or priority value.\",\n      \"when\": \"Their theme and badges are inspected.\"\n     }\n    ],\n    \"ears\": \"Where the light theme is displayed, the Hive Wo